   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ROI Programme, 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has the objective that forcibly displaced and host communities in Afghanistan, Pakistan and Iran enjoy their fundamental rights and actively participate in building inclusive and resilient societies for a sustainable future. This will envisage that refugees and asylum-seekers can realise their rights in line with international protection standards and exercise their freedoms and rights for greater levels of gender equality and self-reliance.</narrative>
